  "title": "International Bancshares Corporation Announces Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "International Bancshares Corporation (NASDAQ: IBOC) announced today that on July 31, 2024, IBC’s Board of Directors approved the declaration of a 66 cents per share cash dividend for shareholders of record of Common Stock, $1.00 par value, as of the close of business on Aug. 14, 2024, payable on Aug. 28, 2024.",
